outside the bathroom. I bumped into somebody.&nbsp;
His name was Greg. He was with 3 other people.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:17.920
Their names were Amy, Susan, and Cindy. And&nbsp;
about an hour later, we had finished our meal&nbsp;&nbsp;

